      <activity id="ab1fd130-0825-54ab-8e98-aa7f3965a56d" activityNameId="45d30bae-c9a1-5e62-8d84-7b8a55587534" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Flax insulation, fireproofed, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Flax insulation, fireproofed, at regional storage
na;
UUID: 1b03f99a-a91c-32a3-8c0b-a58031ec781f
Market dataset representing the supply of fireproof flax insulation in Switzerland. The market share of ARBIO was estimated to 90% by Gaëlle Talandier. The remaining 10% are produced in France and charged with a 10% addition for non-declaration of information. Transport efforts for the imported share are calculated according to the procedure described in the QualiBOB report part A.; Geography: Switzerland
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Modern technology
Time period: 2010 and after
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from dedicated company. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1b03f99a-a91c-32a3-8c0b-a58031ec781f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
